'''Angaité''' is a language of the Paraguayan [[Gran Chaco|Chaco]]. Many children speak only [[Guarani language|Guarani]], but may understand Angaité.<ref name=ISO>[http://www-01.sil.org/iso639-3/cr_files/2013-013_aqt.pdf ISO change request]</ref>

